りです：春麗は蹴り合いで完敗。シェリーの蹴りは春麗の腹を簡単に破壊した。春麗の蹴りはシェリーにはまったく通用しなかった。\nお好きな構図を選んでください。シェリーのサディスティックな笑みとチュンリーの情けない顔が映るようにお願いします。\n\nシェリーの性格やファイトスタイルを見たい人は、以下の2つのビデオを参考にしてほしい。https://drive.google.com/file/d/10f8IlBXaivGW4nm_1WubxH1xM2a-Wm8V/view?usp=sharing と https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hmnbp_F4tFMRm6YbHoFZ53DuwCYfFEUN/view?usp=sharing\n\nありがとうございました。", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 96362, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "力バ", "screen_name": "hippopotamuso", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1143111669410779139/DOyI0zvv.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1646722776/1609926236/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 133457, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "石油", "screen_name": "sekiyuCeltic", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007971606086438912/ZBUoh9oQ.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/331250093/1664980228/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 464535, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぱやみ【skeb受付中】", "screen_name": "payanpayami", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1495625951236935681/6CTaJgbI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/237026291/1625321251/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": nul